        "stage": "History",
        "title": "Lateral elbow pain worsened by gripping and lifting",
        "detail": "Despite the name, most patients are not tennis players — ask about occupational gripping, tools, and household tasks. Medial epicondylitis is the same process at the flexor origin.",
