        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Refer pathological discharge; reassure and review physiological discharge",
        "detail": "Spontaneous, single-duct, blood-stained or serous discharge is referred. Bilateral multi-duct discharge expressed only on squeezing usually is not.",
