        "id": "k9",
        "stage": "Staging and biology",
        "title": "Staged with the TNM system; receptor and HER2 status guide treatment",
        "detail": "Stage, grade and receptor status are assigned by the pathology and multidisciplinary team. Named prognostic indices exist and are applied by that team, not here.",
