        "id": "j6",
        "stage": "The diagnosis not to miss",
        "title": "Male breast cancer",
        "detail": "An eccentric, hard, fixed lump — rather than symmetrical retroareolar tissue — is assessed as a cancer until proven otherwise. Ultrasound is the imaging of choice in the male breast.",
