        "id": "a7",
        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Specialist referral; endoscopic or surgical treatment reduces outflow resistance",
        "detail": "Options include endoscopic dilatation, endoscopic myotomy and surgical myotomy, sometimes with an antireflux procedure. Drug treatment has a limited role.",
