        "stage": "Examine the hernial orifices first",
        "title": "Inspect and palpate every orifice before anything else",
        "detail": "Das makes this the opening move of the examination, and it remains the single most useful habit in this presentation. A strangulated femoral hernia in an elderly woman is the classic miss.",
