        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Urgent referral; surgery with or without chemotherapy according to stage",
        "detail": "Early disease treated by endoscopic resection has a genuinely good outlook, which is a reason to pursue vague dyspepsia in an at-risk patient rather than dismiss it.",
        "next": []
