        "stage": "Confirm the diagnosis",
        "title": "Barium enema, and sigmoidoscopy or colonoscopy with biopsy",
        "detail": "Endoscopy with biopsy both confirms the diagnosis and defines the extent, which drives both treatment and future cancer surveillance.",
