        "stage": "Distinguish from its close mimics",
        "title": "Crohn's disease, infective colitis, and amoebic colitis",
        "detail": "These overlap heavily in presentation. In a region where amoebiasis is common, stool examination for the parasite is part of the routine workup before committing to a diagnosis of ulcerative colitis.",
