        "detail": "Both share ileocaecal involvement, strictures, and a chronic relapsing course. In practice the two are repeatedly mistaken for each other in both directions, and the distinction rests on biopsy findings, culture or molecular testing, and response to a trial of anti-tuberculous treatment where the picture stays genuinely uncertain.",
