        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Urgent referral to a specialist hepatobiliary and pancreatic unit",
        "detail": "Surgical resection offers the only realistic chance of cure and is pursued where the disease allows it; chemotherapy and biliary drainage are used more widely, including for symptom relief where cure is not possible.",
