        "id": "m6",
        "stage": "Correct nutrition before definitive surgery",
        "title": "Malnourished patients need parenteral or enteral support first",
        "detail": "Modern practice favours nutritional optimisation followed by a single-stage resection once the patient can tolerate it, rather than proceeding straight to a technically difficult repair in a depleted patient.",
