        "stage": "Examination",
        "title": "Visible gastric peristalsis, and a palpable olive-shaped mass",
        "detail": "Peristaltic waves passing across the upper abdomen, best seen just after a feed, are a striking sign. A firm, mobile, olive-shaped mass may be felt in the right upper quadrant, though it can be difficult to feel if the infant is unsettled.",
