        "id": "p6",
        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Correct fluids and electrolytes first, then pyloromyotomy",
        "detail": "This is a surgical condition, but it is never an emergency in the sense of needing immediate operation — the priority is always to resuscitate and correct the metabolic disturbance before going to theatre.",
