        "id": "c6",
        "stage": "Decision",
        "title": "Many resolve spontaneously and are simply observed; drainage for large, symptomatic, or complicated pseudocysts",
        "detail": "Size alone is not the deciding factor. Endoscopic drainage is now generally preferred where intervention is needed, with surgical or percutaneous drainage reserved for specific situations.",
