        "stage": "Investigate",
        "title": "Examination under anaesthesia, MRI of the pelvis, and assessment of the bowel itself",
        "detail": "MRI is the standard way to map complex perianal Crohn's disease before any operative intervention. Colonoscopy and biopsy establish or confirm the intestinal diagnosis where it is not already known.",
