        "title": "Indirect hernias follow the processus vaginalis; direct hernias push through a weak posterior wall",
        "detail": "An indirect hernia is pyriform with a stalk at the deep ring and often descends into the scrotum. A direct hernia is more spherical, sitting medially, and rarely enters the scrotum.",
