        "stage": "Search for corroborating evidence",
        "title": "Other syphilitic stigmata, and a history consistent with prior infection",
        "detail": "This search runs alongside, not instead of, full investigation for a possible tumour — the two are not mutually exclusive possibilities to be ranked, but parallel lines of inquiry.",
