        "stage": "Primary hydrocele is the common presentation in middle-aged and older men",
        "title": "Painless, sometimes reaching an enormous size before the patient seeks attention",
        "detail": "The overlying skin is normal in colour and temperature, and the swelling is not tender. It is dull on percussion, in contrast to a hernia, which is often resonant because it contains bowel.",
