        "stage": "Understand the underlying process",
        "title": "An infective gangrene in which fulminating inflammation causes obliterative arteritis of the subcutaneous tissue",
        "detail": "This vascular obliteration is what drives the tissue destruction, and explains why the disease can progress so rapidly once it takes hold.",
