        "stage": "Recognise the clinical picture",
        "title": "Sudden scrotal pain with pyrexia, prostration and pallor",
        "detail": "This systemic upset, out of proportion to what might initially look like a localised scrotal problem, is itself a warning sign that should not be reassured away.",
