        "id": "f5",
        "stage": "Understand the natural history if untreated",
        "title": "Progressive sloughing of the scrotal skin, leaving the testes hanging exposed",
        "detail": "This is a genuinely catastrophic outcome, entirely preventable with early recognition and aggressive treatment — which is the whole reason this condition is treated as an emergency from the moment it is suspected.",
