        "id": "f6",
        "stage": "If there are multiple sinuses, consider the underlying cause specifically",
        "title": "A 'watering-can' perineum, from a neglected periurethral abscess proximal to a urethral stricture",
        "detail": "This specific pattern points to a chronic underlying urological problem rather than an acute, isolated event, and changes the longer-term management once the acute emergency is addressed.",
