        "id": "p2",
        "stage": "The commonest cause is idiopathic thrombosis within the corpora cavernosa",
        "title": "But a specific search for an underlying cause is always worthwhile",
        "detail": "Sickle cell anaemia, leukaemia, secondary malignant deposits in the corpora cavernosa, spinal cord injury, and other organic diseases of the central nervous system are all recognised causes and are actively asked about and considered.",
